msgstr "Receiver"

msgid "Image"
msgstr "Image"

msgid "Kernel"
msgstr "Kernel"

msgid ""
"The kernel decides which memory features are available. It is part of the "
"image and cannot be changed by a plugin."
msgstr ""
"Der Kernel bestimmt, welche Speicherfunktionen verfügbar sind. Er gehört zum"
" Image und kann von einem Plugin nicht geändert werden."

msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

msgid "RAM"
msgstr "RAM"

